  "description": "Low-level, allocation-free primitives that fill genuine BCL gaps: Lemire FastMod/FastDiv, struct PRNGs (xoshiro/xoroshiro/SplitMix64/wyrand/PCG), span LEB128/zig-zag varint codec, integer digit-count/Log10, fast non-crypto GUID v4 / RFC 9562 big-endian v7, power-of-two alignment (AlignUp/AlignDown/IsAligned), bit get/set/scan over caller-owned span bitmaps (SpanBits), sequential sub-byte bit I/O (BitWriter/BitReader), fused/specialized SIMD reductions (single-pass MinMax, overflow-checked sum), guaranteed branch-free conditional select, merge-based set algebra over sorted spans, and Morton/Hilbert space-filling curves. Part of the Celerity family.",
